From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:52:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: AVD and VENC
 bandwidth votes"

This reverts commit 0cdfa3c5df.

The votes were meant to close the J604's 10-bit decode gap. Measured on
the J604 with the vote set by hand, they do not: 4K HEVC 10-bit decodes
at 526, 527, 528 and 529 fps with the bandwidth vote at 0, 18, 19 and 0
again, AV1 10-bit at 485-490 fps, and a kernel carrying these entries
decodes HEVC 10-bit at 547-549 fps, as before them. The write is the one
macOS makes (same entries, word and level), so the vote is not what
macOS has and we lack; holding it only spends fabric power while the
decoder and encoder run.

The pmp-report support for apple,bw-vote stays; without these properties
it writes nothing.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi | 10 ----------
 1 file changed, 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi
index 44395ae198..96cc4ec56e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-lab.dtsi
@@ -1472,14 +1472,6 @@ pmp_report_avd_sys: report@14 {
 		 */
 		power-domains = <&ps_avd_sys>, <&pmp_report_msr>;
 		apple,dvfs = <418 2>;
-		/*
-		 * The memory bandwidth vote macOS writes to SOC-DEV-DVFS 409 +
-		 * 411 at the start of each flat-out decode (q-media-1: level 19
-		 * for HEVC 10-bit and H.264, 18 for AV1). Without it a 4K 10-bit
-		 * frame takes 0.42 ms longer here than on macOS, which pays
-		 * nothing for 10-bit on the same SoC.
-		 */
-		apple,bw-vote = <19>;
 		apple,no-ack;
 	};
 
@@ -1496,8 +1488,6 @@ pmp_report_venc_sys: report@13 {
 		#power-domain-cells = <0>;
 		power-domains = <&ps_venc_sys>, <&pmc_soc_max>;
 		apple,dvfs = <417 2>;
-		/* macOS holds 409 + 411 at main level 0x12 while it encodes. */
-		apple,bw-vote = <18>;
 		apple,no-ack;
 	};
 
